        "sentence": "The data science team at No 10 Downing Street and PolicyEngine co-founder Nikhil Woodruff, a No10 Innovation Fellow from summer 2025, built the 10ds-microsim package on PolicyEngine to estimate how policy reforms affect living standards and local area incomes, and their distributional impacts; the team uses the results as supplementary, experimental analysis.",
