  },
  {
    "entries": [
      {
        "name": "Brookings Institution",
        "sentence": "Brookings authors Sarah Calame and Tara Watson used the PolicyEngine microsimulation model to estimate the cost, poverty effects and distributional effects of a hypothetical plan to make the Earned Income Tax Credit the same for workers with and without children and pay child benefits only through the Child Tax Credit.",
