      {
        "name": "UHERO at the University of Hawaiʻi",
        "sentence": "UHERO based its 2024 analysis of Hawaiʻi's SNAP benefit cliff on an enriched version of PolicyEngine's model, and used PolicyEngine US for the household calculations in its May 2026 brief on the cost of subsidizing child care.",
        "sources": [
          "https://uhero.hawaii.edu/hawai%CA%BBis-unnecessary-benefit-cliff-how-one-small-policy-change-could-deliver-in-45m-per-year-in-federally-funded-snap-benefits/",
